fields.description:
Frame format. Selects one of the ready-made frame formats; custom uses the sync register.

Usage: Write while the unit is stopped. The preset formats derive the frame sync from nslot and slot_w.

Values:
0x0 custom: the sync fields of the sync register are used;
0x1 Philips I2S (reset value);
0x2 left-justified;
0x3 PCM short frame;
0x4 PCM long frame;
0x5 TDM with early sync.

Unit: none.

Limits: 0x6 and 0x7 are reserved.

